{"name": "Of Dice and Minions", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of Dice and Minions is a roguelite auto battler where every roll becomes an army. Roll five dice, hold the ones you need, and chase a poker hand. When you commit, your dice turn into minions and your army takes it from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a roster of heroes, monsters, and questionable recruits. Learn how formations counter each other, survive the Dungeon, and keep descending until something finally stops you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EVERY ARMY STARTS WITH A ROLL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Five dice. Five minions. Up to three rolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hold what you need, reroll the rest, or commit early when the hand is already good enough. Only the dice used in your final hand deploy, so every decision changes the army you send into battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/c84099053d10de841dab49eeacc4bfe0.poster.avif?t=1791144369\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/c84099053d10de841dab49eeacc4bfe0.webm?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/c84099053d10de841dab49eeacc4bfe0.mp4?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WATCH THE DICE COME ALIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each die carries one of your chosen minions. When you commit your hand, those dice become a fighting formation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frontliners take position, ranged units set up behind them, and both armies wait for the signal. Once the fight begins, your preparation has to speak for itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/14c6c7e9e2e371610a14fbb6d36e38ff.poster.avif?t=1791144369\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/14c6c7e9e2e371610a14fbb6d36e38ff.webm?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/14c6c7e9e2e371610a14fbb6d36e38ff.mp4?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TURN LUCK INTO A WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your final hand decides the battle. Pairs, Two Pair, Three of a Kind, Straights, Full Houses, Four of a Kind, and Five of a Kind all hit differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powerful combinations deploy more minions and grant combat bonuses to the current formation. A great roll can rescue a bad situation. Knowing what to hold is what keeps a run alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/8a0124c6306c49d78a6540118e8b1896.poster.avif?t=1791144369\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/8a0124c6306c49d78a6540118e8b1896.webm?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/8a0124c6306c49d78a6540118e8b1896.mp4?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COUNTER OR BE COUNTERED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every formation has a weakness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tanks protect fragile damage dealers. Shadows slip into the back line. Ranged units punish slow advances. Healers keep strong formations standing. The Dungeon will eventually find an answer to whatever is working, so be ready to build one of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/5f4bb4eef18148131ec53e55cf44b80c.poster.avif?t=1791144369\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/5f4bb4eef18148131ec53e55cf44b80c.webm?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/5f4bb4eef18148131ec53e55cf44b80c.mp4?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RECRUIT. COLLECT. DEPLOY.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring your Gold back from the Dungeon and spend it at the Minion Shop. Unlock new recruits, expand your Collection, and learn what every minion brings to a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You only have five dice, and rarity limits keep the strongest recruits from filling every slot. Building the right roster matters more than grabbing every powerful minion you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/d84dfb02e82f2df399350d9966e1ed14.poster.avif?t=1791144369\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/d84dfb02e82f2df399350d9966e1ed14.webm?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/d84dfb02e82f2df399350d9966e1ed14.mp4?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TEMPT FATE BETWEEN BATTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every skull leads to a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Memorize a disappearing roll in Dice Recall. Challenge the host to a Game of Threes. Open treasure, recover lost dice, and keep an eye on anything that looks suspiciously generous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A quiet stop can still change the entire run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/33b377681b3ebbc397662f9b7bfcc47a.poster.avif?t=1791144369\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/33b377681b3ebbc397662f9b7bfcc47a.webm?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/33b377681b3ebbc397662f9b7bfcc47a.mp4?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/96061e0b1bcd45c4bc4ab30c0b57a85f.poster.avif?t=1791144369\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/96061e0b1bcd45c4bc4ab30c0b57a85f.webm?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/96061e0b1bcd45c4bc4ab30c0b57a85f.mp4?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DESCEND AS FAR AS YOU DARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Undead are only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100 floors. Ten zones, each guarded by a boss. New factions, stronger counters, and dangerous events enter the Dungeon as you descend, and familiar formations come back meaner. Clear Floor 100 and Endless mode opens up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you go, the less the Dungeon cares about fighting fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/41dab8c9779e8e23d914a4e4b6692f0c.poster.avif?t=1791144369\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/41dab8c9779e8e23d914a4e4b6692f0c.webm?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/41dab8c9779e8e23d914a4e4b6692f0c.mp4?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/71bb4c45c736662f48db31e1d40d78e7.poster.avif?t=1791144369\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/71bb4c45c736662f48db31e1d40d78e7.webm?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/extras/71bb4c45c736662f48db31e1d40d78e7.mp4?t=1791144369\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Roll five dice and chase poker hands to summon a minion army, then watch it fight. Hold, reroll, recruit, and counter your way down 100 floors in this roguelite auto battler.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4984370/135bbebf387303d7738e9241996090a33086eb64/header.jpg?t=1791144369", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Auto Battler", "Dice", "Roguelite", "Tactical", "Dungeon Crawler"], "developers": "Foorbytes", "publishers": "Foorbytes", "release_date": "Nov 16, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4984370", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/htcaRvuS_Ms", "first_seen": 1791237600.0, "review_rank": 38}